            "paragraph": "Argo is a broad-scale array designed to accumulate about 100 profiles per season in every 10\u00b0 square of ocean. The array is not eddy-resolving, but eddy noise is reduced by averaging over many profiles in a region to estimate large-scale variability. The design was based on statistics from satellite altimetric height and from earlier subsurface ocean data sets (Roemmich et al., 1999).",
